{"ticker":"LHX","updated":"2026-11-07T01:36:06Z","profile":{"longName":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc.","shortName":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.l3harris.com","fullTimeEmployees":45000,"marketCap":48391712768,"trailingPE":24.198326,"forwardPE":19.067528,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0739603,"pegRatio":0.97,"targetMeanPrice":334.4,"targetHighPrice":443.0,"targetLowPrice":241.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.071,"earningsGrowth":0.333,"grossMargins":0.25552,"operatingMargins":0.1434,"profitMargins":0.0876,"totalRevenue":23332999168,"beta":0.455,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":379.23,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":232.34,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.94},"summary":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc. provides mission-critical solutions for government and commercial customers worldwide. It operates through three segments: Space & Mission Systems (SMS), Communications & Spectrum Dominance (CSD), and Missile Solutions (MSL). The SMS segment integrates satellite and payload capabilities, including missile warning and defense, with maritime, air special missions, and other global defense and civil government programs. Its MSL segment unites propulsion, hypersonic, and other advanced missile technologies. The CSD segment provides tactical radios, software, waveforms, satellite terminals, and end-to-end battlefield systems for the U.S. Department of Defense, international, federal, and state agency customers; broadband communications; integrated vision solutions, such as helmet-mounted integrated night vision goggles with image intensifier tubes and weapon-mounted sights, aiming lasers, and range finders; and public safety radios and system applications and equipment. The company was formerly known as Harris Corporation and changed its name to L3Harris Technologies, Inc. in June 2019. L3Harris Technologies, Inc. was founded in 1895 and is headquartered in Melbourne, Florida.","summary_zh":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc. 為全球政府和商業客戶提供關鍵任務解決方案。它透過三個部門運作：太空與任務系統（SMS）、通訊與頻譜優勢（CSD）以及飛彈解決方案（MSL）。 SMS部門將衛星和有效載荷能力（包括飛彈預警和防禦）與海上、空中特殊任務以及其他全球防禦和民政計畫結合。其 MSL 部分結合了推進、高超音速和其他先進的飛彈技術。 CSD 部門為美國國防部、國際、聯邦和州機構客戶提供戰術無線電、軟體、波形、衛星終端和端到端戰場系統；寬頻通訊；整合視覺解決方案，例如帶有影像增強管的頭盔式整合式夜視鏡和武器瞄準器、瞄準雷射和測距儀；以及公共安全無線電和系統應用和設備。該公司前身為 Harris Corporation，於 2019 年 6 月更名為 L3Harris Technologies, Inc.。 L3Harris Technologies, Inc. 成立於 1895 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州墨爾本。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":271.71,"h":274.7,"l":269.26,"c":273.89,"v":1194500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":272.96,"h":273.32,"l":268.6,"c":270.71,"v":1092200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":270.64,"h":275.67,"l":269.86,"c":275.64,"v":951800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":275.82,"h":280.69,"l":274.34,"c":280.63,"v":948500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":280.71,"h":281.68,"l":278.35,"c":279.2,"v":800800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":278.81,"h":282.22,"l":278.46,"c":281.89,"v":783400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":283.63,"h":286.81,"l":282.26,"c":284.27,"v":1332700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":284.16,"h":286.01,"l":281.31,"c":281.86,"v":732500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":279.8,"h":283.28,"l":278.48,"c":282.73,"v":664700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":283.73,"h":284.46,"l":281.75,"c":283.94,"v":1316000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":284.0,"h":285.03,"l":281.49,"c":284.32,"v":785400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":285.34,"h":288.02,"l":284.17,"c":286.19,"v":760300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":287.78,"h":288.23,"l":283.83,"c":284.0,"v":965200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":286.59,"h":290.9,"l":286.0,"c":289.24,"v":1198900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":290.84,"h":293.94,"l":289.68,"c":293.56,"v":1147000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":297.83,"h":298.4,"l":294.77,"c":296.95,"v":1230300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":297.56,"h":305.94,"l":297.56,"c":305.41,"v":1332600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":303.85,"h":304.31,"l":298.18,"c":300.47,"v":1423800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":299.95,"h":301.3,"l":295.62,"c":296.1,"v":1099100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":297.09,"h":299.78,"l":295.4